<title>GERMANY: Germany announces 1997 schedule for jobless data.</title>
<headline>Germany announces 1997 schedule for jobless data.</headline>
<dateline>NUREMBERG, Germany 1996-12-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>The German Federal Labour Office said it would publish unemployment data in 1997 according to the following schedule:</p>
<p>    Release date	  Data for</p>
<p>    January 9	     December 1996</p>
<p>    February 6	    January  1997</p>
<p>    March 6		 February</p>
<p>    April 8		 March</p>
<p>    May 6		   April</p>
<p>    June 6		  May</p>
<p>    July 8		  June</p>
<p>    August 6		July</p>
<p>    September 9	   August</p>
<p>    October 7	     September</p>
<p>    November 6	    October</p>
<p>    December 9	    November</p>
<p>    January 9	     December</p>
<p>-- Bonn newsroom, 49 228 26097150</p>
</text>
